rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 44 "@pulse 1000"
out god "\n\rThe juke bops: 'Just nod if you can hear me.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'Is there anyone home?'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'Come on, now.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'I hear you're feeling down.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'Well I can ease your pain,'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'Get you on your feet again.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'Relax relax relax...'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'I need some information first.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'Just the basic facts:'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'Can you show me where it hurts?'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'There is no pain, you are receding.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'A distant ship's smoke on the horizon.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'You are only coming through in waves.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'Your lips move but I can't hear what you're sayin'.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'When I was a child I had a fever.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'My hands felt just like two balloons.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'Now I got that feeling once again.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'I can't explain, you would not understand.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'This is not how I am.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'I have become comfortably numb.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'Ok ok ok...'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'Just a little pinprick. <ping>'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'There'll be no more --Aaaaaahhhhh!'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'But you may feel a little sick.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'Can you stand up?'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'I do believe it's working. Good.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'That'll keep you going for the show.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'Come on it's time to go.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'There is no pain, you are receding.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'A distant ship's smoke on the horizon.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'You are only coming through in waves.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'Your lips move but I can't hear what you're sayin'.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'When I was a child I caught a fleeting glimpse,'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'Out of the corner of my eye.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'I turned to look but it was gone.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'I cannot put my finger on it now.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'The child is grown, the dream is gone.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'I have become comfortably numb.'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke starts playing U2, Bullet the Blue Sky.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'In the howling wind comes a stinging rain'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe juke bops: 'See it driving nails into souls on the tree of pain'\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9"
